          "diff": "[DELETE] protected static final String DUMP_SITE_BASE_URL = \"http://dumps.wikimedia.org/\" ; [ADD] protected static final String DUMP_SITE_BASE_URL = \"https://dumps.wikimedia.org/\" ;",
