      "test_code": "@Test public void validCurrentDumpPropertiesNewFormat ( ) throws IOException { wrf.setWebResourceContentsFromResource ( \"http://dumps.wikimedia.org/wikidatawiki/20140210/\" , \"/wikidatawiki-20140508-index.html\" , this.getClass ( ) ) ; wrf.setWebResourceContents ( \"http://dumps.wikimedia.org/wikidatawiki/20140210/wikidatawiki-20140210-pages-meta-current.xml.bz2\" , \"Line1\" , CompressionType.BZ2 ) ; wrf.setWebResourceContentsFromResource ( \"http://dumps.wikimedia.org/wikidatawiki/20140210/wikidatawiki-20140210-md5sums.txt\" , \"/wikidatawiki-20140210-md5sums.txt\" , this.getClass ( ) ) ; MwDumpFile dump = new WmfOnlineStandardDumpFile ( \"20140210\" , \"wikidatawiki\" , wrf , dm , DumpContentType.CURRENT ) ; BufferedReader br = dump.getDumpFileReader ( ) ; assertEquals ( br.readLine ( ) , \"Line1\" ) ; assertEquals ( br.readLine ( ) , null ) ; assertTrue ( dump.isAvailable ( ) ) ; assertEquals ( \"20140210\" , dump.getDateStamp ( ) ) ; assertEquals ( DumpContentType.CURRENT , dump.getDumpContentType ( ) ) ; }",
